<title>CHINA: SOCCER-CHINA BEAT U.S. 2-1 IN FRIENDLY.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-CHINA BEAT U.S. 2-1 IN FRIENDLY.</headline>
<dateline>BEIJING 1997-01-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>China beat the United States 2-1 (halftime 2-0) in a friendly soccer international on Wednesday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>China - Hao Haidong (11th minute), Li Tie (30)</p>
<p>U.S. - Eric Wynalda (73)</p>
</text>
